Design a 4-to-4 decoder that converts a 4-bit binary input into a specific 4-bit hexadecimal output. This module maps each of the 16 possible 4-bit input combinations to a corresponding 4-bit output value, thereby transforming the input code into a recognizable output form, suitable for applications such as a keypad interface. In the case of an unrecognized input, it defaults to outputting the code for the numeral '1'.
module top_module(
input [3:0] In, 
output reg [3:0] Out
);

